# Provenance: sigmond-appliance/wisdomf-ryzen5825u — the file the image
# actually bakes (build-golden-vm.sh:142 -> provision-components.sh:245).
# It is COMPLETE: B4 and W3USR-06 both run it and report zero misses in
# /var/lib/ka9q-radio/fft.log, and W3USR-06 walks the full ka9q-web zoom
# ladder without a single fallback.
#
# This replaces a 15124 B / 109-codelet file that had HALF the coverage.
# That mattered the moment _seed_bundled_wisdom() became reachable: a host
# with no wisdom would have been seeded worse than the image already seeds
# it, and the only symptom would have been a slow fft thread.
# Verified 2026-10-02.
